The element types, metadata field names, function signatures and chunking
semantics of tryworks are modeled on that API so tryworks can serve as a
drop-in replacement for its document-partitioning call path. tryworks does
not contain source code copied from unstructured, and its test corpus is
generated by tryworks' own scripts rather than taken from unstructured's
example documents.

